<title>HUNGARY: SHAREHOLDERS MEETING OF BSE-LISTED FIRMS.</title>
<headline>SHAREHOLDERS MEETING OF BSE-LISTED FIRMS.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1997-03-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Following is a list of</p>
<p>upcoming annual shareholders' meeting of companies listed on</p>
<p>the Budapest Stock Exchange.</p>
<p>The table, based on the official financial gazette, Magyar</p>
<p>Tokepiac, will be updated as new official announcements are</p>
<p>published.</p>
